      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/post_installation_configuration/day_2_core_cnf_clusters/updating/update-rhacm-talm-health-checks#core-cluster-upgrades-health-checks">Perform health checks before a cluster update with TALM</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/openshift_container_platform/">OpenShift Container Platform update documentation</a></li>
